# AI DIRECTIVE: SIMPLIFIED CONTEXT RESET
⚠️ CONTEXT RESET DIRECTIVE ⚠️

At the beginning of a new session:

1. Clear previous context
2. Read the current feature status
3. Determine which feature to work on
4. Follow the simplified TDD workflow

Always maintain clear focus on a single feature at a time.
Always complete all steps of the TDD workflow before moving to the next feature.

If returning to a work in progress, check the status of the current feature and continue from the appropriate step in the workflow.